      "text": "Murda Beatz\nShane Lee Lindstrom ( born February 11 , 1994 ) , professionally known as Murda Beatz , is a Canadian hip hop record producer from Fort Erie , Ontario . He is noted for producing songs such as `` No Shopping '' by rapper French Montana , `` Back on Road '' by rapper Gucci Mane , Lindstrom has also produced several tracks for various artists such as Drake , Migos , Travis Scott and PartyNextDoor , among others ."
